  "title": "epan: Prevent UB in tvb_ensure_bytes_exist",
  "description": "Do the same as done in b619f21fff2e632edf21171fa3a90615a5fe522f\nfor compute_compute to prevent UBSan from warning about undefined\nbehavior. Even though in practice all compilers on all 2's complement\narchitectures do exactly what we expect so this is sort of unneeded,\nat the same time in practice all compilers recognize the pattern here\nand optimize it to the same single instruction as without this pattern,\nso preventing UB is good.\n\nPrevents an OSS-Fuzz issue 445230293",
